		{
			dependencies: ["25289F9E8AE01C29"]
			description: [
				"If you're familiar with GregTech, you may be aware of its &cmany nerfs&r to vanilla recipes. &bGTCEu&r doesn't go easy on you - take a look at the crafting recipes for &eBuckets&r or &ePaper&r. However, we'll ease off the insanity in earlygame, and 1 Log will give you 4 Planks. &aRejoice!&r"
				""
				"&o&8\"My adventure starts with some tree punching!? Huh, I thought GregTech was supposed to shake things up a bit...\"&r"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:oak_log"
			id: "0EAF2C5B5EB755C5"
			shape: "square"
			size: 0.75d
			subtitle: "Begin your playthrough as before"
			tasks: [{
				id: "22B6D3C1033D47DA"
				item: "minecraft:crafting_table"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "The Beginning of it All"
			x: -0.75d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0EAF2C5B5EB755C5"]
			description: [
				"Here's a &6nifty&r list of some resources that you'll need in bulk for early-game. Collect more than we're asking for in this quest - you'll end up running out before you know it, and it's always a good habit to gather more than you need in &aGregTech&r."
				""
				"We'd actually advise that you &etackle this quest first&r, so that you can claim its &breward&r. That way, you can do a little bit of main (read: &ointeresting&r) progression &4&lBEFORE&r you're forced to go mining."
				""
				"Eight furnaces might seem &cexcessive&r if you're new to &aGregTech,&r but trust us... you can never have too many."
			]
